/T (The flowchart represents the working process of the Inventory Tracker system developed using Java. It starts by initializing the inventory ArrayList and displaying the main menu. The user can select different operations such as adding products, displaying products, searching products by ID, sorting products by name, and sorting products by price. Based on the selected option, the system performs the required operation and displays the result. After completing an operation, the program returns to the main menu for further actions. If the user selects the Exit option, the program terminates.)
